# One line ending everywhere: Prettier, ruff, shells and containers all expect LF,
# and every modern editor on Windows handles it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Files executed or parsed inside Linux containers must keep LF even on Windows checkouts.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
**/Caddyfile text eol=lf
*.alloy text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.woff2 binary
